  "comments": "A few types are known.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> - all details smaller and closer to the center.<br />\r\nDie<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"> 2</span> - all details a bit larger and further from the center.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span> - all details large and far from the center, new font with thick horizontal strokes.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/614d7ee388282.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/614d7ee388282.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"210\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - thin numerals in &#039;100&#039;.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - thick numerals in &#039;100&#039;, the first word 한 aligned with the left of &#039;1&#039; in &#039;100&#039;, the vertical lower right stroke in syllable 국 between beads.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/614d7efb4dbde.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/614d7efb4dbde.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"203\" /></a><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span> - thick numerals in &#039;100&#039;, the first word 한 aligned with the left of &#039;1&#039; in &#039;100&#039;, the vertical lower right stroke in syllable 국 to a bead.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span> - thicker and close to each other numerals in &#039;100&#039;, the first word 한 aligned closer to center of &#039;1&#039; in &#039;100&#039;, the vertical lower right stroke in syllable 국 to a bead.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/614d7f0dafeda.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/614d7f0dafeda.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" /></a><br /><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> 1983.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> 1984.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/614d7f2422641.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/614d7f2422641.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" /></a><br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> 1985, 1986.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span> 1987-1990.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span> 1991-1999.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/614d7f46cefd4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/614d7f46cefd4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" /></a><br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span> 2000-2016.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/614d7f5a2bd8b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/614d7f5a2bd8b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" /></a><br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev<br /><br />\r\nCorrespondence with Standard Catalog of Worlds Coins:<br />\r\nKM#35.1 <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>;<br />\r\nKM#35.2 <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>, <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>, <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span>, <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span>, <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span>.",
